# StickHeadsTogether Configuration
# Copy to ~/.config/stick-heads-together/.env and fill in your keys

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API Keys (at least one required)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenAI - https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# NOTE: ChatGPT Plus does NOT include API access. You need separate
#       API credits at https://platform.openai.com/account/billing
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini - https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model Configuration (optional - defaults shown below)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Complexity is chosen per tool call: low / medium / high
# Override any of these to use different models per complexity level.

# ─── OpenAI Models ───
# Paid API only - no free tier. ~$5 minimum credit purchase required.
#
# GPT-6 lineup (2026-10), prices per 1M tokens (input / output):
#   - gpt-6-luna      $0.10 / $0.50     fast, high volume
#   - gpt-6.1-sol     $2.00 / $10.00    everyday balance, newest release
#   - gpt-6-astra     $10.00 / $50.00   flagship
#
# gpt-6-sol costs the same as gpt-6.1-sol - always prefer 6.1.
# Previous generation (gpt-5.6-luna/-terra/-sol) still works but is not cheaper.
# List the models your own key can access:
#   curl https://api.openai.com/v1/models -H "Authorization: Bearer $OPENAI_API_KEY"
COUNCIL_OPENAI_LOW=gpt-6-luna
COUNCIL_OPENAI_MEDIUM=gpt-6.1-sol
COUNCIL_OPENAI_HIGH=gpt-6-astra

# ─── Gemini Models ───
#
# NOTE: gemini-2.5-* is retired for new API keys ("no longer available to
#       new users") - do not use it as a default anymore.
#
# Verified working (2026-10), prices per 1M tokens (input / output):
#   - gemini-3.5-flash-lite    $0.30 / $2.50   free tier, newest flash-lite
#   - gemini-3.8-flash         $0.75 / $3.75   free tier, newest flash
#                              ($1.50 / $7.50 from 2027-01-01)
#   - gemini-4-argon           $2.00 / $10.00  PAID ONLY, flagship
#                              ($4.00 / $20.00 from 2026-12-01)
#
# Without billing, gemini-4-argon fails with "quota exceeded" - set
# COUNCIL_GEMINI_HIGH=gemini-3.8-flash in that case.
# Moving aliases: gemini-flash-latest, gemini-pro-latest (auto-follow releases,
# but can change price/behaviour without you noticing).
#
# List the models your own key can access:
#   curl "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models?key=$GEMINI_API_KEY"
#
# Rate limits / tiers: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits
COUNCIL_GEMINI_LOW=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
COUNCIL_GEMINI_MEDIUM=gemini-3.8-flash
COUNCIL_GEMINI_HIGH=gemini-4-argon
